{
  "text": "Let me be the first to say your property deserves the investment from your real estate agent. There are a lot of things I stand by as non -negotiables for my clients, but the most important one is transparency. Being in the top 1 % of agents in North Carolina is not something I take lightly. I've invested heavily in my client's success, and that investment goes far beyond what you can see. Yes, Zillow Showcase, Homes .com, Retargeting Ads, and Maximum Exposure, but it's the internal work, my negotiation skills, and how I show up every single day. Because far more goes into this than what's visible. Your agent's character, their integrity, and how they show up for themselves will always reflect on how they treat you and your family. I would be honored to get to know you and serve you. Whether you're buying, building, or selling, click the link in my bio.",
